# Security policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please report it privately, never in a public issue or pull request:
[open a private security advisory](https://github.com/{{ github_org }}/{{ project_name }}/security/advisories/new)
(the repository's **Security** tab, then **Report a vulnerability**). Only the maintainers see it.

Say what is affected, how to reproduce it and what an attacker could do with it. We reply within
five working days, keep you updated while we fix it, and credit you in the advisory unless you
would rather we did not.

## Supported versions

{% if flavour == "library" %}
Only the latest release gets security fixes.
{% else %}
Only `main` gets security fixes; the notebooks always install the helper package from `main`.
{% endif %}
